        have already paid for — it takes effect at your next renewal,
        and we will tell you before that renewal is charged. Prices
        exclude any sales tax, VAT, or similar charge; where we are
        required to collect one, it is added at checkout.
      </p>

      <h3>Player dues and card entry fees</h3>
      <p>
        Where it is switched on for an organizer, a league director or
        tournament host can collect dues or an entry fee from their
        players by card. Those payments are processed by Stripe
        <strong>into the host's own Stripe account</strong>, not ours:
        Bagpipe Golf provides the software and takes no custody of that
        money. Setting the amount, collecting it, and refunding it —
        <strong>including the terms on which they refund, which are
        theirs to set</strong> — are the host's responsibility, and any
        dispute about it is between the host and their players. See
        "Refunds of player dues" above.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>We take a 2% platform fee</strong> on each such card
        payment, before the money reaches the host. Players see one total
        at checkout, not a separate line for us. That fee, and the card
        processor's own fee, are not returned if the payment is later
        refunded — see "Refunds" above. This capability is enabled per
        organizer and is not available to every account.
      </p>

