        <li>You may collect entry fees or dues from your players. If you collect them yourself, outside the app, that is entirely between you and your players. If you use the card feature where it is available to you, the money goes to your own Stripe account, and <strong>whether and how you refund a player is your decision, on your terms</strong> — see §7.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If you accept a tournament invite:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You agree to the rules the organizer has configured for the tournament, including format, handicap allowances, and any side games they've enabled.</li>
        <li>You may withdraw from a tournament at any time before scoring starts; once scoring begins, withdrawals are subject to the organizer's rules.</li>
      </ul>

